{
  "name": "dsh-town-life",
  "version": "1.5.2",
  "description": "橡溪镇生活线：15 个地点、12 家商店、72 件商品（家具行 27 件家具）、76 个 2D 模型（支持自绘图替换/清单页）、每日委托、按时间干活与精力/饱食、小屋俯视平面图自由布置、舒适值与邻居串门、NPC 好感度与送礼、设置面板与实时地图。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale",
    "docs",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "slots"
      ],
      "external": [
        "react"
      ]
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22",
    "dsh": ">=0.2.1-rc.2"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "town": "node lib/serve.mjs"
  }
}